{
  "slug": "tmux-status",
  "name": "Tmux Status",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "This plugin appends an icon to your tmux window name so you can know what Claude Code is doing without having to open up the window. No tmux config changes needed :D",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **9 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `tmux-icons` (Switch tmux status icon themes or customize individual icons for the claude-tmux-status plugin)\n- **Hooks** (9): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionEnd`, `PermissionRequest`, `ElicitationResult`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tmux-status@claude-community` from `haxybaxy/claude-tmux-status`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
